// Syncthing ignore patterns for the student-portal share (Mac <-> NAS ONLY — never Ryan's
// devices; .env secrets and student data must not leave Aaron's machines).
// .stignore is per-device and NOT synced: install this same file on BOTH sides
// (Mac: folder root; NAS: /share/Container/Syncthing/data/student-portal/.stignore).

// Git internals — DO NOT SYNC (same rule as AP-Social-Media, 2026-06-02: Syncthing
// cannot safely merge refs/index; a two-machine main fork corrupts the repo).
// The Mac is the ONLY git machine for this project; NAS Claude does admin ops, not commits.
// History flows through GitHub (Aaron-Sapient/student-portal), not Syncthing.
.git
**/.git

// Secrets stay OFF the Syncthing data tree (rule of record, 2026-05-25).
// NAS Claude reads Supabase creds from /root/.claude/secrets/supabase-admissions-partners/
// (already present on the devbox: ap-dashboard.txt + student-hubs.txt — both projects the
// portal's .env.local points at, verified 2026-08-12).
.env*
**/.env*

// Build artifacts / deps — machine-specific, huge (753M + 1.1G on the Mac).
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.vercel
**/.turbo
**/dist

// Claude Code machine-local state — per-machine allowlists; sync only CLAUDE.md.
!.claude/CLAUDE.md
(?d).claude/**

// macOS metadata — (?d) so it never blocks a remote directory deletion.
(?d).DS_Store
(?d)**/.DS_Store

// Editor noise
**/.vscode
**/.idea
**/*.swp
